{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37785","headline":"访题表兄王藻渭上别业 · 郑谷","name":"访题表兄王藻渭上别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桑林摇落渭川西，蓼水弥弥接稻泥。\n幽槛静来鱼唱远，暝天寒极鴈行低。\n浊醪最称看山醉，冷句偏宜选竹题。\n中表人稀离乱後，花时莫惜重相携。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37785.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37785","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}